OL,3,GNEWSATiny zebra-striped bee in West a
OL,4,A'huge surprise'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tiny zebra-striped bee, usually found
OL,7,Falong England's south and east coasts,
OL,8,Fhas made an unexpected journey to the
OL,9,FWest Country.
OL,11,FThe rare sea aster mining bee has been
OL,12,Fspotted at Steart Marshes in Somerset
OL,13,Fby naturalist Nigel Phillips, who said
OL,14,Fthe find "was a huge surprise".
OL,16,FThe Wildfowl and Wetlands Trust said
OL,17,Fsaltmarsh restoration work at the
OL,18,Fnature reserve had helped create the
OL,19,Fperfect home for the newcomer.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
